# =============================================================================
# Powertype 4 — City (geographic granularity between country and spot)
#
# CATEGORICAL_CLASS whose members are the cities carrying spot-level
# harvest categories; the city CLASS_REFERENCE property on ScenicSpot
# is sourced from the city-level harvest category an entry came from.
# =============================================================================

